{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"valid\":true,\"entry\":\"第一眼落在左上方白色大字及紫色强调词“那些气不该忍”“开心的事”上；随后容易被下方字号更大、蓝色强调的第二句吸引。两块大字都很显眼，缺少唯一明确的视觉入口。\",\"grasp_who\":\"只看出他仍被过去的事情牵扯，似乎在与过去和自己较劲；具体处境不确定。\",\"grasp_feel\":\"不服气、难受。\",\"missed\":\"如今已经不在那些人身边；争得没了力气后，不服气逐渐淡去，真正留下的是分离带来的难受。上下两段之间的情绪变化和关系不容易第一眼拿到。右上角阶段目录及中间小字的背景信息也不容易抓到。\",\"burden\":[\"上下两块大号文字都很显眼，争夺主视线。\",\"核心意思分散在两块大字里，需要拼接才能理解从不服气到因离开那些人而难受的变化。\",\"单块大句包含多层意思，不能只靠放大的关键词直接判断完整处境和感受。\",\"中间小字连续排列，需要在多条信息之间挑选。\"],\"score\":2}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3ed1184e-eca7-43df-8d5a-e4e7630da633", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T022657272046Z", "elapsed_seconds": 27.094, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:27:24.368123+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "faa5107bbd6b63dd414baec690607ed8cff58503dc5dd2a237bc7a7cc0d1e106", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "t